Cinecore: spatial audio on headphones and built-in speakers. With --coreaudio-spatial=auto multichannel PCM keeps its layout and goes through AUSpatialMixer (Apple's renderer, personalized HRTF, AirPods head tracking) instead of being downmixed to stereo. HDMI receivers and other speakers are untouched.

